{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOPSTICKS</strong> is a local multiplayer fighting game set across the globe. With just <strong>one attack button</strong> and a focus on <strong>parrying</strong>, strategy is key. Each map opens up <strong>unique gameplay opportunities</strong> with map specific elements: from giant lasers to sticks that can be used as swords!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982670/extras/8b2b5b97aa0be6c766cff99ede9de45c.avif?t=1774090139\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982670/extras_big/8b2b5b97aa0be6c766cff99ede9de45c.webp?t=1774090139 width=1560 height=144 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982670/extras/d35da1068c31e420fd7c90ef8dce4cd3.poster.avif?t=1774090139\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982670/extras/d35da1068c31e420fd7c90ef8dce4cd3.webm?t=1774090139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982670/extras/d35da1068c31e420fd7c90ef8dce4cd3.mp4?t=1774090139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each map is set in a <strong>different country</strong> with unique location specific details and interactive elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982670/extras/ab91cce3b41466c0c683aba9c41242f7.avif?t=1774090139\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982670/extras_big/ab91cce3b41466c0c683aba9c41242f7.webp?t=1774090139 width=1560 height=144 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982670/extras/7650d07a06bc587bee4237b6069a579e.poster.avif?t=1774090139\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982670/extras/7650d07a06bc587bee4237b6069a579e.webm?t=1774090139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There is<strong> no </strong>hold to block.  <strong>Perfectly catch/parry\u00a0</strong>your opponents punches, kicks or swings to respond with <strong>super powerful moves</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982670/extras/5422f96f0d95c9b4b5db2a77280906bf.avif?t=1774090139\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982670/extras_big/5422f96f0d95c9b4b5db2a77280906bf.webp?t=1774090139 width=1560 height=144 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982670/extras/1566d067ca5d0d878ecb5e46fd9aac26.poster.avif?t=1774090139\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982670/extras/1566d067ca5d0d878ecb5e46fd9aac26.webm?t=1774090139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982670/extras/1566d067ca5d0d878ecb5e46fd9aac26.mp4?t=1774090139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every map has its own <strong>gameplay altering mechanic</strong>, keeping fights fresh.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982670/extras/320ff7527fe058851f37b82b76ba0fae.avif?t=1774090139\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982670/extras_big/320ff7527fe058851f37b82b76ba0fae.webp?t=1774090139 width=1560 height=144 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982670/extras/9a54206e64298fd7803342f9a147413f.poster.avif?t=1774090139\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982670/extras/9a54206e64298fd7803342f9a147413f.webm?t=1774090139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With just a single attack button, combat is easy to pick up. Context  based moves and directional inputs add strategy and depth to fights.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982670/extras/c43e86f0cac7c3fa4511a6cf5dd9e357.avif?t=1774090139\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982670/extras_big/c43e86f0cac7c3fa4511a6cf5dd9e357.webp?t=1774090139 width=1560 height=144 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982670/extras/f0042ae1283ddd0f49f0355eea0429e7.poster.avif?t=1774090139\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat